MODULE: RearmRefreshesSecondRefreshSkipped
TARGET: RearmRefreshes
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: only the first rearm refreshes its phase
PERTURBS: ReArm

--- FIND
            ![l].refreshed = TRUE, ![l].round = @ + 1,
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: latch after the first refresh; the next opportunity invalidates it.
            ![l].refreshed = (leaf[l].round = 0), ![l].round = @ + 1,
--- END
